  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your songs echo with the voices of a hundred dead ancestors.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> War Singer<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When your bardic performance gains the benefit of your War Singer feat, the range or area of your chosen performance is tripled rather than doubled and the DC for saving throws against your bardic performance is increased by +2.</p>\n<p>This stacks with the bonus War Singer applies for creatures of the orc subtype.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-t-z-feats#toc30\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
